    {
      "id": "p0108-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "A goofy skeleton named Sans plays a major role in Undertale. His name comes from a popular - and notorious - English computer font known as \"Comic Sans\". Unsurprisingly, Sans' English dialogue text uses the Comic Sans font.",
        "raw": "A goofy skeleton named Sans plays a major role in Undertale. His name comes\nfrom a popular - and notorious - English computer font known as \"Comic\nSans\". Unsurprisingly, Sans' English dialogue text uses the Comic Sans font.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29677739,
          0.36652857,
          0.89518564,
          0.4141
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29473382,
          0.36581429,
          0.91071676,
          0.41517143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          15,
          16,
          17
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "名叫 Sans 的滑稽骷髅在 Undertale 中扮演着重要角色。他的名字来自一种很流行、也臭名昭著的英文电脑字体“Comic Sans”。不出所料，Sans 的英语台词用的正是 Comic Sans 字体。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 24,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
      },
      "annotations": [],
