    {
      "id": "p0108-b011",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because Undertale relies so much on different fonts and font-related jokes, Japanese fans have had a lot to say about the official localization's font choices. This is good example of how the localization process, by its very nature, can produce new, significant debate over matters that never concerned the original audience.",
        "raw": "Because Undertale relies so much on different fonts and font-related\njokes, Japanese fans have had a lot to say about the official localization's\nfont choices. This is good example of how the localization process, by its\nvery nature, can produce new, significant debate over matters that never\nconcerned the original audience.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.31781593,
          0.81807857,
          0.87503604,
          0.89171429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.31648761,
          0.81736429,
          0.87636436,
          0.89278571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          49,
          50,
          51,
          52,
          53
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Undertale 大量运用不同字体及字体相关的笑话，因此日本粉丝对官方本地化的字体选择有许多意见。这很好地说明，本地化过程本身就可能让原版受众从未在意的问题，变成新的重大争论。",
        "status": "draft",
